cellPad: keyboard fallbacks and the SDL gamepad thread.

- macOS keyboard fallback (arrows, Z=CROSS, X=CIRCLE, A, S, Q, W, 1, 2, Return=START, Tab=SELECT), and the same
  mapping with SDL (SDL_GetKeyboardState, while the window has the focus) on Linux and Windows.
- The SDL gamepad layer runs on one dedicated thread, so a controller plugged in after the start is seen.

